                <p>Compare the telegram of March 5, 1941, from Paasikivi to the Finnish Foreign
                    Office, in <hi rendition="#italic">Finland Reveals Her Secret Documents on
                        Soviet Policy, March 1940–June 1941</hi>, p. 94.</p>
            </note>
